    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.120" end="00:03.170" ttm:agent="v1">Hey, Macklemore, can we go thrift shopping?</p>
      <p begin="00:03.170" end="00:05.620" ttm:agent="v1">What? What? What? What?</p>
